{"id": "tech-2", "headline": "Anthropic launches Claude Ship for code approvals", "source": "TechCrunch", "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/23/anthropic-launches-claude-ship-letting-ai-agents-review-fix-and-approve-code-changes/", "published": "2026-11-23", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Anthropic on Monday announced Claude Ship, a suite of AI agents for reviewing, fixing and approving routine code changes. It includes Code Review, which is already generally available, and two beta agents. PR Steward handles failing CI checks, merge conflicts and Code Review feedback, and comments on what it changed and how to roll it back. Claude Approvals applies an approval policy that a team writes in natural language as a file in its repository. The notable part is automatic approval, which delegates sign-off to an AI agent. Anthropic says AI coding agents now produce so much code that review has become a bottleneck.", "Because the tools are in beta, the company suggests caution when using the approval function. Source: TechCrunch."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110010100001011101101100011001111111", "10000010110010010100011011111100001000001", "10111010001010111001111010001010001011101", "10111010111010010101001111100101101011101", "10111010010110111011110110001111101011101", "10000010111000100110000000011100101000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000000110101001110000110010100000000", "11111011100011000101001011010100010101010", "11000101011011001011110100100111111111011", "00000010000001111000100010110010100110000", "10101100110001011000111000001001001111000", "01100010011100111100001011010100000001111", "10110100110011010101100100001011111111101", "01110011101000111010101010011110010110100", "01000100111010110010011100111001001011010", "00100010000011111100101001001100000000100", "10011001010100101011101101000011111110011", "00100010100010011110101010110000000010000", "10110100001000110000011100100001100111010", "1011111110011001011000110111